Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanParkingLotWithObstructedView" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large structural beams obstructing view of parked vehicles and buildings" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Obstructed view of parked vehicles and surroundings due to structural beams" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surface indicating potential slippery conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk due to obstructed view and parked vehicles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Parked vehicle partially visible behind structural beams" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

Risk 1:
Description: Obstructed view of parked vehicles and surroundings due to structural beams
Severity Score: 0.9

